{"v":4,"catch":"重新發現原版《Backyard Baseball 1997》，現已更新為 Nintendo Switch™ 版本","desc":"「重溫這款開創一切的遊戲！原版《後院棒球 1997》現已加強至可在 Nintendo Switch™ 上執行。無論您是要挑選您的夢想球隊、打出全壘打，或是只是來看喜劇，都可以回到後院，體驗讓每個人都能享受棒球樂趣的遊戲！\n\n從 30 位充滿魅力個性與俏皮戲謔的經典角色中建立您的花名冊，並透過強力提升、火球投球、超強力量與 Pablo Sanchez，在競爭中取得優勢！\n\n透過任何人都能掌握的簡單、直覺式操控，進行接球遊戲、練習打球，以及單場比賽或整個球季的競賽。","publisher":"Playground Productions","release":"2025-06-12","genres":["運動","模擬","街機"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.4GB / Switch 0.4GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/43303b2683b952e409a6272de2653923ae185f8be3f850da59043316bb1eeaec.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6d605e2474a4acb0fe602f9785d1fad4167466db9a5310041e9d810d544b395e.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/43c9ec4e0bf9c8534e08ba1002de1a0e864870da2664ee7c3fa51496d34e212c.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9e7ec5f007fd09a4d233fed0f4a9f6bcf53603fecc71bad02fc224eef30a2f94.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a45501830f8f93500f8adf6192b14717e81f7727a47ff9ce7d7259f7b5e1706d.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4484f02c9d91ac2673722d7436eb37bf33f3c965e1b739107ecef1083ca9c6d9.jpg"],"titleId":"0100646023172000","dlc":[]}